.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-cert-auto 1  "ngx-cert-auto " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-cert\-auto \- Turn automatic renewal on or off (sets `autorenew` in the certbot renewal config)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-cert\-auto\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISITE\fR> <\fISTATE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn automatic renewal on or off (sets `autorenew` in the certbot renewal config)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISITE\fR>
Site ID or domain
.TP
<\fISTATE\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  sudo ngx cert auto 2 on
